==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{recons|gʷabʰ-|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|βάπτω|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkʰaːva/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|aːva|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|kafaði|kafað}}

# to [[dive]], to go so deep [[underwater]] that one can't be seen
#: ''[[hann#Icelandic|Hann]] '''kafaði''' 20 [[metri|metra]] [[undir]] [[yfirborð|yfirborðið]].''
#:: He '''dived''' 20 [[meter]]s [[under]] the [[surface]].

